# Runtime dependencies of acmt001-lsp, mirroring [tool.poetry.dependencies]
# in pyproject.toml. Hash-pinned in runtime.txt so the release SBOM
# installs nothing unpinned (OpenSSF Scorecard Pinned-Dependencies); the
# package itself goes on with --no-deps.
# Regenerate with: make pip-compile
# The suite releases in lockstep, core first: the floor is this release.
# runtime.txt, ci.txt and fuzz.txt still pin acmt001 0.0.9 until the core
# 0.0.12 is on PyPI; then `make pip-compile` relocks them.
